      "page": 1,
      "body": "Does anyone have experience with having fitted crib sheets sewn in Hong Kong? I have a standard size cot mattress (140x70cm) but would like to supply my own cotton or flannel in a cute print to match the nursery decor. I may just start asking alterations places in my neighborhood, but thought it might've better to find a place that makes bedding specifically since I plan to start from scratch (or give them a purchased sheet to copy as a pattern).\n\nThanks for any help!\n\nPosted via Mobile Device",
